{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_8000_situation", "source_sha256": "6ca68b16ae01705b86439f4cf00794bc601cf04ecd0ee2e97cbd5ceafed93d65", "ja": "グラビア撮影のお仕事　撮影前", "zh": "写真拍摄的工作　拍摄前", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_8000_place", "source_sha256": "a60904b53463e9c648b3e3152825423fc3c58d897685240c3c8dd4e85a5491b2", "ja": "昇降口", "zh": "出入口", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_8001_p", "source_sha256": "f529638df94de8a746c985558136ad1d0824312a1a0cbdc7d9ef5c5222ce608e", "ja": "（アイドル雑誌『ViDaVo!』のグラビア企画で、\n翼の高校生姿をイメージした撮影だ）", "zh": "（在偶像杂志《ViDaVo!》的写真企划中，将以翼的高中生形象为主题进行拍摄）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_8002_016tsu", "source_sha256": "7cf6e9fcef6a7d7878e7c143e539f34d4a9f6d6672c9bcb441aac9733b8ed12f", "ja": "{$P$}さん、今のわたし、\nどうですか？　高校生！　って感じしますよね？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，现在的我，\n怎么样？很有“高中生！”的感觉对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_8003_p", "source_sha256": "ba482cb55ccc194f54e56a0e51be3b5cebf4ba12dce9f16f11fa91ef82f7fefd", "ja": "もちろん。よく似合ってるよ。\n普段よりも、お姉さんって感じがしていいと思う。", "zh": "当然。很适合你。\n比平时更有大姐姐的感觉，我觉得很不错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_8004_016tsu", "source_sha256": "fc157fdc97e8cdb7baa84629dfe28090cb951c569d53cbeb1a07b517f40a85ad", "ja": "え～？　その反応、なんか思ってたのと違うかも。\nもっとこう……ドキッとしてほしかったのにな～。", "zh": "诶～？这个反应，好像和我想的不太一样。\n本来还想让你更加……心动一下的呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_8005_016tsu", "source_sha256": "4e1ac83eeed2f761924183ef9979b4bda6e4c6e52197b97ccbcc939362f52e80", "ja": "あ、刺激が足りないのかも！　だったら……\n{$P$}さん！", "zh": "啊，可能是刺激还不够吧！那就……\n{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_8006_016tsu", "source_sha256": "2f740b3d3947f13a3ed1b68fc22991f1e77b0c1328224856c6da6ebf2c429993", "ja": "今のわたしとデートするなら、どんなことがしたい\nですか？　撮影の参考に、教えてくださーい♪", "zh": "如果和现在的我约会，您想做些什么呢？为了给拍摄作参考，请告诉我——♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_8007", "source_sha256": "1d0c7e303d2eee3ec3fe55850fe2f3ec5f10fe95089a54933c161d794d7fe02f", "ja": "勉強", "zh": "学习", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_8008", "source_sha256": "156877b5b3ddee5bc23709d7e50ca9a29e8874d3d507255e455e92adf9b31358", "ja": "ショッピング", "zh": "逛街购物", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_8009", "source_sha256": "d626ecafe6c45ab66be2a9996e00fd3f6c0b976eeb57cf04eb1474763428e094", "ja": "映画", "zh": "电影", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_8100_p", "source_sha256": "619e773948e76e7902ad84e80ebb2856e6a5596339684f839d877439ca68066f", "ja": "勉強かな。そういうデートって、\n大人になってからだと、できないと思うし。", "zh": "学习吧。因为我觉得，长大以后就没法进行那种约会了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_8101_016tsu", "source_sha256": "54ab9e9813ad149451b9cc7baf818dc29f05235c38bfe09beccad9eb51f3cb74", "ja": "へ～、{$P$}さんって\nそういうのが好きなんですね。それじゃあ……", "zh": "哦～，原来{$P$}先生喜欢这种啊。那就……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_8102_016tsu", "source_sha256": "6220869f422640b58e10d329ce95d40b090cb386c7e072967ee0711e6b3b3c03", "ja": "ふたりで一緒にドキドキできそうなこと、\n勉強してみませんか？　……なーんて♪", "zh": "要不要一起学习一下，能让我们两个人都心跳加速的事情？……开玩笑的啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_8200_p", "source_sha256": "5d0aac44986e4d81a6d4a085f5089f0494edda73fc7c2df3553292b5a3c9a90c", "ja": "ショッピングはどうかな。放課後デートって\n学生の時しかできないことだと思うんだけど。", "zh": "去逛街怎么样？我觉得放学后的约会，是只有学生时代才能体验的事情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_8201_016tsu", "source_sha256": "4fc0a721437a788e1cb5dd639adb529d8f877f9469add6924fb49a593c43c138", "ja": "たしかに！　いつもと同じショッピングも、\n服装が違うだけで気分も変わりますもんね～♪", "zh": "确实呢！平时一样的购物，只是换了身打扮，心情也会跟着改变嘛～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_8202_016tsu", "source_sha256": "d4f74182ceb8ab2b529b93afb5b6976b66b75e7508a7877ecc996211b7f7fc07", "ja": "よーし！　{$P$}さんをドキドキ\nさせちゃうショッピングプラン、考えてみますね。", "zh": "好～嘞！我会好好想想能让{$P$}先生心跳不已的逛街计划的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_8300_p", "source_sha256": "21691f3bbc15299e3fcdb6770b685b6d8286b364cb63fc1be34d5edc900767fb", "ja": "定番だけど、映画はどうだ？\n見終わった後は、カフェで感想会もできるし。", "zh": "虽然是老套路，不过看电影怎么样？\n看完之后，还可以在咖啡厅聊聊感想。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_8301_016tsu", "source_sha256": "db3ae7cf85e25ab8bfb81ec591a03a0f624bf0715de90d4f4b196ef7174a2e3c", "ja": "悪くないですけど～……でも、それって、わたし以外の\nことを見たり考えたりするってことですよね？", "zh": "倒也不坏啦～……不过，那不就意味着要去看电影、思考电影，而不是看着我、想着我了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_8302_016tsu", "source_sha256": "39034728349bf68b0117492e54f6d8a86a08936e614b6260d957e0178e6cfac0", "ja": "それは、つまんないかも……。ちょっと他の人にも\n聞いてみますね。ありがとうございましたー！", "zh": "那样可能有点无聊……我去问问其他人吧。谢谢你啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
